{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40487","headline":"吊李翰林 · 曹松","name":"吊李翰林","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"李白虽然成异物，逸名犹与万方传。\n昔朝曾侍玄宗侧，大夜应归贺监边。\n山木易高迷故壠，国风长在见遗篇。\n投金渚畔春杨柳，自此何人系酒船。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹松","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40487.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40487","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}